<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not well tested-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not well tested-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Carcass basis - Steers not well tested with heifers not tested. Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1275 lbs ld 110.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Tues -  100   Week to Date - 2,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
